WEBVTT

00:12.740 --> 00:14.700
The Seven Days Clergy...

00:14.700 --> 00:17.470
They must be the guys Adalmann hates.

00:18.710 --> 00:22.120
I don't know what brings you here,
but don't get in my way.

00:22.120 --> 00:24.590
Hinata and I already settled
things between ourselves.

00:24.590 --> 00:26.970
I'm not going to let her die now.

00:27.430 --> 00:30.130
Unfortunately, we cannot allow that.

00:30.130 --> 00:34.810
That woman has ignored
the will of our lord Luminus.

00:34.810 --> 00:39.480
We cannot let such blasphemy
go unpunished.

00:40.170 --> 00:41.480
B-But!

00:41.480 --> 00:43.170
Please forgive Lady Hinata!

00:43.170 --> 00:44.440
She had her own thought for—

00:44.440 --> 00:45.860
Enough with the act!

00:46.900 --> 00:50.240
How dare you trick me,
Seven Days Clergy!

00:50.240 --> 00:53.280
You have been meaning to have
Lady Hinata dead from the beginni—

00:56.450 --> 00:59.300
Garde? Wh-What are you...

01:00.710 --> 01:02.830
Such insolence, Renard.

01:02.830 --> 01:05.590
You were the one
conspiring with the rebel Hinata

01:05.590 --> 01:07.760
and tricked us all along, weren't you?!

01:07.760 --> 01:10.510
Huh? Hey, what's going on here?!

01:10.930 --> 01:11.800
Report.

01:11.800 --> 01:14.800
The individual called Garde's
wavelength is similar

01:14.800 --> 01:17.810
to the one that interfered with the sword.

01:17.810 --> 01:21.100
That means he's the guy
who shot Hinata?

01:21.600 --> 01:24.480
Shion, strip off that Garde guy's cover!

01:24.480 --> 01:25.320
Yes, sir!

01:25.320 --> 01:26.530
Watch out.

01:26.530 --> 01:29.110
He might even be one of
the Seven Days guys himself.

01:29.110 --> 01:31.820
As expected from a monster.
You have a keen nose.

01:31.820 --> 01:34.490
That means I don't need
this disguise anymore!

01:37.870 --> 01:42.870
Using force? Well, don't be so hasty,
Demon Lord Rimuru.

01:42.870 --> 01:46.090
Do you wish to wage war
against Lubelius?

01:46.090 --> 01:48.460
This is my nation.

01:48.460 --> 01:51.840
Here we perform body checks
on suspicious visitors.

01:51.840 --> 01:54.760
Great Rimuru.
I have an urgent report.

01:54.760 --> 01:58.220
Diablo? I'm in the middle of
something right now, so make it short.

01:58.220 --> 01:59.720
Pardon me.

02:00.130 --> 02:03.620
I have discovered the ones
who killed Reyhiem.

02:03.620 --> 02:05.930
It appears a group that
goes by "Seven Days Clergy"

02:05.930 --> 02:08.150
has been pulling the strings
from behind the scenes.

02:08.150 --> 02:09.150
Oh?

02:09.150 --> 02:12.740
And I'm facing three of those
vermin right now.

02:12.740 --> 02:15.200
I fear leaving them alive
might cause us harm.

02:15.650 --> 02:18.950
Can you provide evidence
that they're the real killers?

02:18.950 --> 02:22.960
We have journalists from around
the world here as eyewitnesses.

02:23.830 --> 02:26.210
Permission granted.
Exterminate them.

02:26.930 --> 02:27.990
As you wish.

02:45.480 --> 02:47.480
THAT TIME I GOT REINCARNATED AS A SLIME

03:59.550 --> 04:00.760
Benimaru, Soei!

04:00.760 --> 04:01.390
Yes, sir!

04:01.390 --> 04:03.650
Work with Shion
and capture the Seven Days Clergy!

04:03.650 --> 04:06.020
If they resist,
you may take any measures necessary.

04:06.020 --> 04:06.770
Just what I was waiting for!

04:06.770 --> 04:08.440
EPISODE 58: GOD AND DEMON LORD
Just what I was waiting for!

04:08.440 --> 04:10.560
EPISODE 58: GOD AND DEMON LORD
As you wish, Great Rimuru.

04:12.610 --> 04:14.150
Well, well.

04:14.150 --> 04:15.740
Are you quite sure?

04:15.740 --> 04:18.570
It will really mean
an all-out war against us.

04:18.570 --> 04:20.030
Look who's talking.

04:20.030 --> 04:23.530
Not only did you meddle with my message
and ruin our chance of peaceful talk,

04:23.530 --> 04:26.700
you are also the one
who killed the Archbishop.

04:26.700 --> 04:30.420
But trying to pin the blame
on my butler was a mistake.

04:30.420 --> 04:32.340
Your cover has been blown!

04:33.090 --> 04:33.960
Then...

04:33.960 --> 04:35.920
The Seven Days Clergy
was behind all of this?!

04:35.920 --> 04:37.220
No way...

04:39.010 --> 04:42.430
I didn't think you would
figured it that far.

04:42.430 --> 04:45.600
But the Saint is already dying.

04:45.600 --> 04:48.680
We wouldn't dream of
missing this golden opportunity!

04:48.680 --> 04:52.230
And since the rest of you
know the truth as well,

04:52.230 --> 04:55.320
we will dispose of you
along with the Demon Lord!

05:02.410 --> 05:04.060
There's nothing to be worried about.

05:04.060 --> 05:06.410
It doesn't matter what you learn here.

05:06.410 --> 05:10.210
We planned to kill all of you
from the beginning, after all!

05:11.500 --> 05:13.330
Now, let us begin.

05:14.710 --> 05:16.710
Th-This...

05:16.710 --> 05:18.460
Hell Flare!

05:18.460 --> 05:20.220
Arcane Thread Slash!

05:21.680 --> 05:23.930
It's useless! Useless, useless!

05:23.930 --> 05:25.010
Shut up!

05:25.010 --> 05:29.430
That means nothing in the face of
my Goriki-maru Version 2!

05:35.020 --> 05:37.480
You imbecile!
What could that sword possibly—

05:40.490 --> 05:41.290
Answer.

05:41.290 --> 05:44.570
She appears to have altered the space
using the Certain Outcome effect of

05:44.570 --> 05:46.240
her Master Chef Unique skill.

05:46.630 --> 05:49.040
What an absurd girl...

05:49.040 --> 05:49.970
Report.

05:49.970 --> 05:51.830
While the possibility is slim,

05:51.830 --> 05:56.040
the subject Shion's attack might
also be effective against you.

05:56.040 --> 05:57.250
For real?!

05:57.250 --> 05:58.710
O-Oh no!

05:58.710 --> 06:01.380
At this rate, the magic circle
will break completely!

06:01.380 --> 06:04.610
So be it! We must release it now!

06:05.390 --> 06:07.890
Die and begone!

06:07.890 --> 06:10.350
Trinity Break!

06:12.180 --> 06:13.040
Report.

06:13.040 --> 06:15.770
Relaunching Ultimate skill Beelzebub.

06:15.770 --> 06:16.810
What?!

06:21.240 --> 06:22.660
Impossible!

06:23.990 --> 06:29.410
Wait a second! Didn't we sacrifice
Beelzebub to survive Hinata's attack?

06:29.410 --> 06:30.200
Affirmative.

06:30.200 --> 06:32.710
I had prepared a backup copy,
so it was not a problem.

06:32.710 --> 06:34.790
What?! Backup?!

06:34.790 --> 06:36.970
You could've told me that earlier!

06:36.970 --> 06:38.590
I thought I couldn't use it anymore—

06:38.590 --> 06:39.360
Report.

06:39.360 --> 06:41.170
Detecting a rise in elemental power.

06:41.170 --> 06:42.420
Main attack incoming.

06:42.420 --> 06:44.180
This is your end, Demon Lord!

06:49.100 --> 06:52.350
Trinity Disintegration!

06:59.020 --> 07:00.440
Oh no!

07:00.440 --> 07:02.940
Beelzebub ain't gonna cut this one out!

07:02.940 --> 07:04.610
It is not a problem.

07:04.610 --> 07:08.570
Activate Ultimate skill
Uriel's Absolute Defense?

07:08.570 --> 07:09.830
Uriel?

07:09.830 --> 07:15.540
Oh, it's the skill that you got
when I was consolidating my abilities, right?

07:16.110 --> 07:18.630
Also, if I have Absolute Defense,

07:18.630 --> 07:21.800
did we really need
to sacrifice Beelzebub back then?

07:23.300 --> 07:25.010
For now, the answer is yes.

07:25.010 --> 07:27.290
That aside, Raphael-sensei...

07:27.290 --> 07:27.890
Hm?

07:28.390 --> 07:30.220
I'd like to talk with you after this.

07:30.220 --> 07:31.980
Yes. With pleasure.

07:34.730 --> 07:36.230
Great Rimuru!

07:46.070 --> 07:48.190
All bark and no bite, huh.

07:56.960 --> 07:59.040
That couldn't be!

07:59.750 --> 08:02.460
Impossible! It is Impossible!

08:02.460 --> 08:05.380
There could be no creature
in this world

08:05.380 --> 08:08.970
who could withstand
a direct blast of Disintegration!

08:11.800 --> 08:15.180
All right, now it's our turn.

08:16.240 --> 08:19.270
The magic circle you're so proud of
seems to have disappeared.

08:19.270 --> 08:21.690
Think you can withstand
this a second time?

08:21.690 --> 08:23.980
You trash aren't going anywhere.

08:23.980 --> 08:25.450
Prepare yourself!

08:26.860 --> 08:29.610
We're the guardians of humanity!

08:29.610 --> 08:32.740
The followers of our lord Luminus
will not be quiet about this!

08:32.740 --> 08:34.740
We will step back this time,

08:34.740 --> 08:40.330
but Luminus's rage will eventually
burn all of you to ashes!

08:41.380 --> 08:42.630
Who is it?!

08:50.760 --> 08:54.140
You... You are...!

08:54.890 --> 08:58.890
Demon Lord Rimuru, it appears
I have caused quite a trouble for you.

08:59.330 --> 09:01.810
Oh, hey. Long time no see.

09:01.810 --> 09:02.980
Who would have guessed...

09:03.310 --> 09:07.110
Demon Lord Valentine
is the God Luminus.

09:13.620 --> 09:16.830
Now, everyone, are you all right?

09:18.370 --> 09:22.250
What an annoying demon.
To think you're this capable...

09:22.250 --> 09:24.170
A fearsome foe, indeed.

09:24.170 --> 09:27.920
Let us show him our sacred power.

09:27.920 --> 09:30.550
Let's do this! Prepare to launch!

09:31.760 --> 09:35.810
It was clear that they
intended to kill you all.

09:35.810 --> 09:37.520
Don't you agree?

09:39.180 --> 09:41.890
But rest assured.

09:41.890 --> 09:44.440
I will protect you all.

09:44.440 --> 09:47.070
Wh-What do you want from us?

09:49.240 --> 09:51.610
I appreciate your quick uptake.

09:51.610 --> 09:54.160
I only seek one thing from all of you.

09:54.160 --> 09:57.990
To spread the truth about
the killing of the Archbishop.

09:57.990 --> 10:00.330
In ways you all are best at, of course.

10:00.660 --> 10:04.580
Of course! We will spread
the word far and wide!

10:04.580 --> 10:07.500
We will also write about
how you gallantly protect us!

10:07.500 --> 10:10.130
Please! Please save us!

10:11.090 --> 10:12.420
Very well.

10:12.420 --> 10:16.220
I promise I will protect all of you.

10:16.220 --> 10:17.600
But...

10:18.760 --> 10:21.640
...not you, King Edward.

10:21.640 --> 10:24.140
Wh-Why?! What did I ever do—

10:24.140 --> 10:25.600
Silence!

10:25.600 --> 10:28.860
You mocked the great
and magnificent Rimuru.

10:28.860 --> 10:31.240
It is a crime worth a thousand deaths.

10:31.240 --> 10:33.990
Know that your life is worth nothing.

10:35.160 --> 10:38.740
Please! Please, I ask you!

10:38.740 --> 10:42.080
Allow me, no, I beg you!
Save me, too!

10:42.080 --> 10:43.830
I will give you everything!

10:43.830 --> 10:47.040
I'll give you my money,
my position, even my throne!

10:47.040 --> 10:48.920
The throne?

10:48.920 --> 10:54.300
Come to think of it, the Champion Youm is
guarding Edmaris at the moment, is he not?

10:57.900 --> 11:04.020
I believe he's the one qualified
to lead the land of Falmuth,

11:04.020 --> 11:05.900
but what do you think?

11:05.900 --> 11:09.320
I-I agree with you!
He has great potential!

11:10.020 --> 11:15.030
A-All of you! I wish to announce
Sir Youm as my successor!

11:15.030 --> 11:17.280
Could you write about this as well?

11:18.660 --> 11:20.950
The birth of a Champion king, is it?

11:20.950 --> 11:23.040
Then we must tell
the world all about it!

11:23.040 --> 11:24.620
Very well.

11:24.620 --> 11:28.000
The plan finally yielded
a satisfactory result.

11:28.000 --> 11:30.810
All left is to dispose of the garbage.

11:32.590 --> 11:36.880
While you're taking your sweet time,
we're all ready over here.

11:36.880 --> 11:39.550
Prepare yourself, demon!

11:39.550 --> 11:42.680
There is no escaping this spell!

11:42.680 --> 11:44.930
Trinity Break!

11:51.920 --> 11:57.820
Taste the despair of the sensation of
powerlessness in a slowly crumbling world!

11:57.820 --> 11:59.160
Activate.

11:59.160 --> 12:01.200
Despair Time.

12:04.540 --> 12:06.500
What is this?!

12:06.500 --> 12:09.210
Our spell... Our spell just disappeared!

12:09.210 --> 12:11.130
I-Impossible!

12:11.130 --> 12:15.710
You may reflect upon your foolishness
in the deepest pit of the abyss.

12:16.470 --> 12:18.840
W-Wait! How could this...

12:18.840 --> 12:20.720
H-Hey! Hey!

12:21.260 --> 12:24.390
This sort of thing should not be allowed!

12:24.390 --> 12:27.020
No...! Is there nothing we can—

12:40.780 --> 12:42.450
Now...

12:42.450 --> 12:45.490
Time to report to Great Rimuru.

12:50.670 --> 12:52.130
Kneel!

12:52.130 --> 12:54.250
I am the Holy Emperor Louis!

12:54.250 --> 12:58.670
And the one standing here before you
is our one and only lord...

12:59.340 --> 13:01.800
...Lady Luminus!

13:03.470 --> 13:05.810
L-Lady Luminus?!

13:05.810 --> 13:07.890
That person is... our God?!

13:09.440 --> 13:12.190
A Demon Lord acting as a God?
What kind of joke is this?

13:12.190 --> 13:13.110
Affirmative.

13:13.110 --> 13:15.370
She should be capable of

13:15.370 --> 13:18.360
making an environment
to efficiently rule humans.

13:18.360 --> 13:19.780
Hinata...

13:19.780 --> 13:22.410
I told you to restrain yourself,

13:22.810 --> 13:24.770
but you decided to venture here anyway...

13:27.490 --> 13:29.180
Resurrection!

13:38.960 --> 13:42.090
Why is a Demon Lord using Holy magic?

13:42.090 --> 13:44.430
I guess now is not
the right time to ask that.

13:45.140 --> 13:48.930
This is undoubtedly a divine miracle.

14:00.190 --> 14:03.030
On my way to my high school
entrance ceremony...

14:03.030 --> 14:05.450
...I fell to this world.

14:12.410 --> 14:14.630
Hey, there's another one over here.

14:14.630 --> 14:16.880
And it's a young girl, too.

14:16.880 --> 14:19.000
She'll sure sell for quite the price.

14:19.000 --> 14:22.790
Let's taste her before we sell her off.
Nobody would notice.

14:24.530 --> 14:27.640
I see. This place's no different, huh.

14:28.180 --> 14:30.850
The world is filled with despair.

14:31.640 --> 14:34.350
- Shut up! Just give it to me!
- No! Stop doing this!

14:34.350 --> 14:35.900
Stop it!

14:35.900 --> 14:40.230
My dad started gambling
and beat my mother.

14:52.500 --> 14:54.830
I want to fix my broken home.

14:55.420 --> 14:57.840
That was all I ever wanted.

15:02.300 --> 15:04.550
But ever since his death,

15:05.110 --> 15:07.390
my mom's heart broke.

15:07.390 --> 15:10.390
I had a talk with God this morning.

15:11.140 --> 15:14.640
I kept having things precious
to me taken away.

15:14.640 --> 15:17.860
My father's company,
my mother's heart...

15:17.860 --> 15:19.650
...and those happy days.

15:20.170 --> 15:22.210
They were all taken away.

15:23.600 --> 15:26.160
I'm done letting things
be taken from me.

15:26.160 --> 15:28.070
If it's going to happen again anyway,

15:28.070 --> 15:30.490
I'll be the one doing the taking!

15:30.490 --> 15:32.240
Confirmed.

15:32.240 --> 15:35.120
Learning Unique skill Usurper.

15:35.120 --> 15:36.250
Succeed.

15:39.040 --> 15:41.090
I am right.

15:41.480 --> 15:43.960
There is no error in my calculation.

15:44.510 --> 15:46.370
Survival of the fittest.

15:46.930 --> 15:50.350
That is the unchanging law of this world.

15:50.350 --> 15:51.970
Confirmed.

15:51.970 --> 15:54.970
Learning Unique skill Mathematician.

15:55.560 --> 15:57.100
Succeed.

16:26.380 --> 16:29.640
Se... Sensei...?

16:30.010 --> 16:32.220
Hey, get yourself together, okay?

16:32.220 --> 16:33.890
I'm not your "Sensei."

16:34.680 --> 16:40.650
Seeing her up close like this, she looks
so innocent, or rather, immature.

16:41.140 --> 16:43.980
It has been a decade since she got
summoned to this world

16:43.980 --> 16:46.190
during her high school years, right?

16:46.190 --> 16:48.650
Um, so that means...

16:48.650 --> 16:49.390
Hey.

16:50.530 --> 16:54.330
You were thinking something rude
just now, weren't you?

16:54.740 --> 16:56.580
No, not at all!

16:56.580 --> 16:59.080
So? How long do you plan to stare at me?

16:59.080 --> 16:59.710
Huh?

17:00.460 --> 17:03.460
Oh, excuse me! It was such
a delight to the eye!

17:03.460 --> 17:04.280
Hmm?

17:05.210 --> 17:08.630
Has anyone ever told you
that you have no tact?

17:09.340 --> 17:12.510
I bet you were never popular
with women like that.

17:13.600 --> 17:15.600
Th-That's not true!

17:15.600 --> 17:18.480
I was known as
a considerate and reliable guy!

17:20.190 --> 17:21.600
That's great, then.

17:23.360 --> 17:25.650
I feel I just lost, somehow.

17:28.440 --> 17:30.740
Now, Seven Days Clergy.

17:30.740 --> 17:34.120
What excuse do you intend
to make for this?

17:34.470 --> 17:36.740
Great Rimuru, the job is complete.

17:36.740 --> 17:38.700
Great. How did it go?

17:40.290 --> 17:41.960
Everything is according to plan.

17:45.880 --> 17:47.800
L-Lady Hinata?

17:47.800 --> 17:49.880
- Renard!
- Lady Hinata!

17:50.630 --> 17:52.130
I sentence you all to death!

17:52.760 --> 17:56.850
I'll at least do the courtesy
of ending you with my own hand.

17:56.850 --> 17:58.270
H-Have mercy on us!

17:58.270 --> 18:00.770
We only did this for your sake,
Lady Luminus!

18:00.770 --> 18:04.400
I swear by our years
of faith to you, please!

18:04.400 --> 18:06.270
Death Blessing!

18:23.870 --> 18:25.920
Well, now that's settled...

18:26.340 --> 18:30.550
There's no use standing here,
so how about we take this elsewhere?

18:30.950 --> 18:34.680
To talk about the future of
Tempest and Lubelius.

18:44.100 --> 18:47.310
What are they doing?

18:47.710 --> 18:50.230
Why haven't they reported
anything back to me?

18:50.230 --> 18:51.690
Is something the matter?

18:52.240 --> 18:55.110
You seem to be very peeved
about something.

18:55.110 --> 18:56.320
You...

18:56.870 --> 18:58.620
Why are you here?

18:59.750 --> 19:03.080
I've made a rather interesting discovery.

19:03.510 --> 19:05.170
A discovery, you say?

19:05.830 --> 19:09.490
I've found some traces
of tampering in this.

19:10.340 --> 19:16.760
To be honest, I don't really care
what your objectives are.

19:16.760 --> 19:20.680
Be it to gain favor from
the God Luminus...

19:20.680 --> 19:24.350
Or to take advantage of her power...

19:24.740 --> 19:27.020
What a strange thing to say.

19:27.020 --> 19:29.560
Our lord lies
in the heart of his believers—

19:29.560 --> 19:31.400
Enough of this farce.

19:31.400 --> 19:33.690
God Luminus does exist.

19:33.690 --> 19:37.110
I noticed that a long time ago.

19:37.110 --> 19:42.330
I only pretended not to notice because
Lady Hinata wanted to keep it a secret.

19:42.330 --> 19:43.580
You...!

19:43.580 --> 19:46.080
That's why, I truly don't care.

19:46.420 --> 19:49.420
I don't care about you,
nor did I care about Luminism!

19:50.420 --> 19:52.500
The evil must perish!

19:52.500 --> 19:54.460
Disintegration!

20:08.560 --> 20:10.310
Darn insects.

20:10.310 --> 20:15.110
Did they really think I would let
anyone harm Lady Hinata?

20:15.550 --> 20:20.120
If there is God in this world, that would be
none other than Lady Hinata herself!

20:20.820 --> 20:22.940
As it is to me!

20:34.050 --> 20:35.630
Curse you...

20:35.630 --> 20:37.550
Nicolaus!

20:37.550 --> 20:41.720
It's dangerous.
That town is dangerous.

20:41.720 --> 20:43.810
Tempest is too dangerous.

20:44.250 --> 20:45.850
Mariabell...

20:45.850 --> 20:47.430
You mean the angels' arrival?

20:47.430 --> 20:49.940
No, Grandfather.

20:49.940 --> 20:53.820
That Demon Lord seeks to rule
the world through economy.

20:54.230 --> 20:55.480
He couldn't be...

20:55.480 --> 20:58.530
It is true, and it will happen.

20:58.530 --> 21:01.700
That's why we must crush him.

21:02.050 --> 21:03.490
I see.

21:03.490 --> 21:06.700
If that's what you say,
I'm sure it shall be so.

21:06.700 --> 21:10.330
Yes, and next time,
it will happen.

21:11.370 --> 21:14.540
I swear it on my name
as Mariabell the Greedy.

21:20.840 --> 21:22.220
You're finally back, Rimuru!

21:22.220 --> 21:25.930
Now it must be my turn
as the final line of defense!

21:25.930 --> 21:29.680
Oh, sorry, the final line of defense
turned out to be unnecessary.

21:29.680 --> 21:30.350
What?!

21:31.230 --> 21:34.590
I was waiting here with
bated breath, all this time!

21:37.900 --> 21:40.320
Oh, it's you! Demon Lord Luminus!

21:40.320 --> 21:44.280
How was that?
I remembered you this time!

21:44.280 --> 21:45.580
Demon Lord Luminus!

21:45.580 --> 21:46.530
What?!

21:46.530 --> 21:48.040
Lord Luminus...

21:48.040 --> 21:50.080
...is Demon Lord Luminus Valentine?

21:51.830 --> 21:54.210
You accursed lizard!

21:54.210 --> 21:58.170
You always get in my way,
EVERY SINGLE DAMNED TIME!!!

22:11.430 --> 22:14.310
I'll vent out all my frustration on you!

22:15.440 --> 22:16.650
Embrace Drain.

22:20.070 --> 22:21.190
Answer.

22:21.190 --> 22:25.820
She appears to be draining
her target's energy

22:25.820 --> 22:30.120
while at the same time transferring
pain and discomfort to her target.

22:30.120 --> 22:34.580
So not even a spiritual creature
like Veldora can resist that, huh.

22:34.580 --> 22:36.040
L-Let's talk this out!

22:36.040 --> 22:37.790
That is Veldora?

22:37.790 --> 22:40.510
The fearsome Storm Dragon?

22:40.510 --> 22:42.010
Unbelievable.

22:42.010 --> 22:43.970
I feel kinda sorry for him.

22:43.970 --> 22:47.370
R-Rimuru! Do something about
this stubborn woman—

22:47.370 --> 22:49.970
Oh? It sounds to me that you
still have room to take more.

22:52.930 --> 22:55.600
So with that, we made up with Luminus.

22:55.990 --> 22:58.150
The misunderstanding
with Hinata was cleared,

22:58.150 --> 23:03.240
and Tempest became officially
recognized by the Western nations.

24:36.430 --> 24:39.430
Next time,
"Reconciliation and Agreement."
